  "question": {
    "text": "A chimney of <math> <mrow> <mtext>20&nbsp;m</mtext></mrow> </math> height standing on the top of a building subtends an angle whose tangent is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> at a distance of <math> <mrow> <mtext>70&nbsp;m</mtext></mrow> </math> from the foot of the building, then the height of building is"
